smart.error.parent_closed = Dokhumente ya mutswari yi pfariwile. Tirhisa Hlayisa tani hi ku hlayisa dokhumente leyi ya leswi nga endzeni.
smart.error.file_changed = Fayili leyi hlanganisiweke yi cincile ehandle ka Schist. Tirhisa Hlayisa tani hi ku hlayisa leswi u swi hleleke, kutani Hlanganisa xilo xa vutlhari nakambe kumbe Pfuxeta swifaniso leswi hlanganisiweke.
